<title>POLAND: BPH gives PLN 60 mln loan to coal trader. [CORRECTED 17:25 GMT]</title>
<headline>BPH gives PLN 60 mln loan to coal trader. [CORRECTED 17:25 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects loan from 30 mln to 60 mln)</p>
<p>Polish Bank Przemyslowo-Handlowy SA (BPH) gave state-owned coal trader Weglokoks SA two loans worth about 60 million zlotys, BPH said.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that Weglokoks received a short-term loan worth 6.2 percent of BPH's owned funds and a long-term loan worth 5.7 percent of the bank's funds.</p>
<p>At the end of 1995, BPH's owned funds totalled 500 million zlotys. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
